  "title": "默认忽略所有文件",
  "url": "https://packagemain.tech/p/gitignore-everything-by-default",
  "date": "2026-09-05 21:19:28",
  "author": "Alex Pliutau",
  "siteName": "Hacker News",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Post header\" class=\"post-header\">\n   <h3 dir=\"auto\" class=\"subtitle subtitle-HEEcLo\">An opposite view on .gitignore files.</h3>\n   <div aria-label=\"Post UFI\" role=\"region\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-paddingBottom-16 pc-reset\">\n    <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-paddingTop-16 pc-paddingBottom-16 pc-justifyContent-space-between pc-alignItems-center pc-reset\">\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-12 pc-alignItems-center pc-reset byline-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-reset\">\n       <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-row pc-gap-8 pc-alignItems-center pc-justifyContent-flex-start pc-reset\">\n        <div style=\"--scale:36px;--offset:9px;--border-width:4.5px;\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-row pc-alignItems-center pc-justifyContent-flex-start pc-reset ltr-qDBmby\">\n         <a href=\"https://substack.com/@pliutau\" aria-label=\"View Alex Pliutau's profile\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-contents pc-reset\"> \n          <div style=\"--scale:36px;\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-width-36 pc-height-36 pc-justifyContent-center pc-alignItems-center pc-position-relative pc-reset bg-secondary-UUD3_J flex-auto-j3S2WA animate-XFJxE4 outline-detail-vcQLyr pc-borderRadius-full overflow-hidden-WdpwT6 sizing-border-box-DggLA4 pressable-sm-YIJFKJ showFocus-sk_vEm container-TAtrWj interactive-UkK0V6 avatar-u8q6xB last-JfNEJ_\">\n           <div style=\"--scale:36px;\" title=\"Alex Pliutau\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-width-36 pc-height-36 pc-justifyContent-center pc-alignItems-center pc-position-relative pc-reset bg-secondary-UUD3_J flex-auto-j3S2WA outline-detail-vcQLyr pc-borderRadius-full overflow-hidden-WdpwT6 sizing-border-box-DggLA4 container-TAtrWj\">\n            <picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260905164311_a0c6d6c3-6518-472f-8cce-d1c6a4ad5177_2000x2000.jpeg 1x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260905164311_a0c6d6c3-6518-472f-8cce-d1c6a4ad5177_2000x2000.jpeg 2x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260905164311_a0c6d6c3-6518-472f-8cce-d1c6a4ad5177_2000x2000.jpeg 3x\"><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260905164311_a0c6d6c3-6518-472f-8cce-d1c6a4ad5177_2000x2000.jpeg\" alt=\"Alex Pliutau's avatar\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260905164311_a0c6d6c3-6518-472f-8cce-d1c6a4ad5177_2000x2000.jpeg 1x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260905164311_a0c6d6c3-6518-472f-8cce-d1c6a4ad5177_2000x2000.jpeg 2x, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260905164311_a0c6d6c3-6518-472f-8cce-d1c6a4ad5177_2000x2000.jpeg 3x\" draggable=\"false\" class=\"img-OACg1c object-fit-cover-u4ReeV pencraft pc-reset\"></picture>\n           </div>\n          </div> \n         </a>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-reset\">\n       <div class=\"pencraft pc-reset color-primary-zABazT line-height-20-t4M0El font-meta-MWBumP size-11-NuY2Zx weight-medium-fw81nC transform-uppercase-yKDgcq reset-IxiVJZ meta-EgzBVA\">\n        <span style=\"min-width:0;\" data-state=\"closed\"><a href=\"https://substack.com/@pliutau\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset decoration-hover-underline-ClDVRM reset-IxiVJZ\">Alex Pliutau</a></span>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-4 pc-reset\">\n        <div class=\"pencraft pc-reset color-secondary-ls1g8s line-height-20-t4M0El font-meta-MWBumP size-11-NuY2Zx weight-medium-fw81nC transform-uppercase-yKDgcq reset-IxiVJZ meta-EgzBVA\">\n         <time datetime=\"2026-09-05T13:19:28.665Z\" title=\"2026-09-05T13:19:28.665Z\">Sep 05, 2026</time>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-16 pc-justifyContent-space-between pc-alignItems-center pc-reset flex-grow-rzmknG post-ufi\">\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\">\n      <div class=\"like-button-container post-ufi-button style-button\">\n       <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Like (2)\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft post-ufi-button style-button has-label with-border\">\n        <div class=\"label\">2</div>\n       </button>\n      </div>\n      <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"View comments (0)\" data-href=\"https://packagemain.tech/p/gitignore-everything-by-default/comments\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft post-ufi-button style-button post-ufi-comment-button no-label with-border\"></button>\n      <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" id=\"radix-P0-27\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft post-ufi-button style-button has-label with-border\">\n       <div class=\"label\">2</div>\n      </button>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\">\n      <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft post-ufi-button style-button has-label with-border\">\n       <div class=\"label\">Share</div>\n      </button>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div class=\"dt-post-body dropCap-hcUVpW\">\n    <div class=\"available-content\">\n     <div dir=\"auto\" class=\"body markup\">\n      <p>I think we’ve all been there. You’re working on a project, making commits, and then suddenly realize you’ve been committing .DS_Store files, node_modules, IDE configuration files, or other junk (CLAUDE.md for example) that shouldn’t be in your repository. Or even worse - environment variables. Then comes the embarrassing cleanup: adding these files to .gitignore, removing them from the repository history, and hoping that no one has noticed.</p>\n      <div data-callout=\"true\" class=\"callout-block\">\n       <p>What if we flipped this approach entirely? Instead of allowing everything by default and selectively ignoring files, what if we ignored everything by default and only allowed specific files?</p>\n      </div>\n      <p>Here’s what this could look like in practice for a simple Go project:</p>\n      <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-gap-8 pc-padding-20 pc-reset bg-primary-zk6FDl outline-detail-vcQLyr pc-borderRadius-sm sizing-border-box-DggLA4 container-KfNFl_\">\n       <div data-line-numbers=\"true\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-reset overflow-auto-7WTsTi scrollBar-hidden-HcAIpI code-G_k53t\">\n        <pre><code>*\n!.gitignore\n!*.go\n!README.md\n!go.mod\n!go.sum</code></pre>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <p><span>This </span><code>.gitignore</code><span> file does exactly that:</span></p>\n      <ul>\n       <li>\n        <p><code>*</code><span> - Ignore everything</span></p>\n       </li>\n      </ul>\n      <p>But not these files...</p>\n      <ul>\n       <li>\n        <p><code>!.gitignore</code><span> - the gitignore file itself</span></p>\n       </li>\n       <li>\n        <p><code>!*.go</code><span> - Go source files</span></p>\n       </li>\n       <li>\n        <p><code>!go.mod</code><span> - Go module file</span></p>\n       </li>\n       <li>\n        <p><code>!go.sum</code><span> - Go dependencies file</span></p>\n       </li>\n       <li>\n        <p>anything else you wish to include</p>\n       </li>\n      </ul>\n      <p>With this setup, only the files you explicitly allow will be tracked by Git. No more accidental commits of unintended local files.</p>\n      <p>The technique isn’t necessarily the right choice for every repository or developer, but is an alternative to explore.</p>\n      <p>Nowadays, I see that projects have so much crap locally, like various agentic docs or subfolders, so it may seem easier to just ignore everything at first.</p>\n      <p><span>Just look at </span><a href=\"https://github.com/microsoft/typescript-go/blob/main/.gitignore\">this 207-lines .gitignore</a><span> from typescript-go.</span></p>\n      <p>p.s. if you want to check if the path is ignored by git, you can run this command:</p>\n      <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-gap-8 pc-padding-20 pc-reset bg-primary-zk6FDl outline-detail-vcQLyr pc-borderRadius-sm sizing-border-box-DggLA4 container-KfNFl_\">\n       <div data-line-numbers=\"true\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-reset overflow-auto-7WTsTi scrollBar-hidden-HcAIpI code-G_k53t\">\n        <pre><code>git check-ignore -v internal/server/server.go</code></pre>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <p>This can save a lot of head-scratching when a file you expected to track doesn’t appear in Git.</p>\n      <p><span>p.s. have you heard of </span><a href=\"https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit\">lazygit</a><span>? The best Git TUI out there, check it out.</span></p>\n      <div class=\"captioned-image-container\">\n       <figure>\n        <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260905164311_66737cc1-4fea-4340-a7cf-1401dc895d52_1280x720.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\" class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img can-restack\"> \n         <div class=\"image2-inset\">\n          <picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260905164311_66737cc1-4fea-4340-a7cf-1401dc895d52_1280x720.jpeg 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260905164311_66737cc1-4fea-4340-a7cf-1401dc895d52_1280x720.jpeg 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260905164311_66737cc1-4fea-4340-a7cf-1401dc895d52_1280x720.jpeg 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260905164311_66737cc1-4fea-4340-a7cf-1401dc895d52_1280x720.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260905164311_66737cc1-4fea-4340-a7cf-1401dc895d52_1280x720.jpeg\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/66737cc1-4fea-4340-a7cf-1401dc895d52_1280x720.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:720,&quot;width&quot;:1280,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:566,&quot;bytes&quot;:169055,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://packagemain.tech/i/214294429?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F66737cc1-4fea-4340-a7cf-1401dc895d52_1280x720.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" alt srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260905164311_66737cc1-4fea-4340-a7cf-1401dc895d52_1280x720.jpeg 424w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260905164311_66737cc1-4fea-4340-a7cf-1401dc895d52_1280x720.jpeg 848w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260905164311_66737cc1-4fea-4340-a7cf-1401dc895d52_1280x720.jpeg 1272w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260905164311_66737cc1-4fea-4340-a7cf-1401dc895d52_1280x720.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"sizing-normal\"></picture>\n          <div class=\"image-link-expand\">\n           <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\">\n            <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"></button>\n            <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\">\n             <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\">\n              <polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line>\n             </svg>\n            </button>\n           </div>\n          </div>\n         </div> \n        </a>\n       </figure>\n      </div>\n      <p><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49576258\">Discuss this post on Hacker News.</a></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"post-footer\">\n    <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-16 pc-paddingTop-16 pc-paddingBottom-16 pc-justifyContent-space-between pc-alignItems-center pc-reset flex-grow-rzmknG border-top-detail-themed-k9TZAY border-bottom-detail-themed-Ua9186 post-ufi\">\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\">\n      <div class=\"like-button-container post-ufi-button style-button\">\n       <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Like (2)\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft post-ufi-button style-button has-label with-border\">\n        <div class=\"label\">2</div>\n       </button>\n      </div>\n      <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"View comments (0)\" data-href=\"https://packagemain.tech/p/gitignore-everything-by-default/comments\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft post-ufi-button style-button post-ufi-comment-button no-label with-border\"></button>\n      <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" id=\"radix-P0-56\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft post-ufi-button style-button has-label with-border\">\n       <div class=\"label\">2</div>\n      </button>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\">\n      <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft post-ufi-button style-button has-label with-border\">\n       <div class=\"label\">Share</div>\n      </button>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-contents pc-reset pubTheme-yiXxQA\">\n    <div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-paddingTop-16 pc-paddingBottom-16 pc-justifyContent-flex-start pc-reset\">\n     <button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft buttonBase-GK1x3M buttonText-X0uSmG buttonStyle-r7yGCK priority_secondary-S63h9o size_md-gCDS3o\">\n      <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-left\">\n       <path d=\"m12 19-7-7 7-7\"></path><path d=\"M19 12H5\"></path>\n      </svg>\n      Previous\n     </button>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "一种替代性的 .gitignore 策略：默认忽略所有文件，仅显式放行已知文件，减少 IDE 配置、环境变量及其他杂项被意外提交的风险。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "一种替代性的 .gitignore 策略：默认忽略所有文件，仅显式放行已知文件，减少 IDE 配置、环境变量及其他杂项被意外提交的风险。",
  "summary": "文章提出翻转传统的 .gitignore 方式：不是默认放行所有内容再选择性忽略不需要的文件，而是默认忽略所有文件，仅显式白名单放行需要追踪的文件。作者用一个简单的 Go 项目举例说明否定模式（如 `!*.go`、`!go.mod`）。他们认为，随着本地项目中积累的 AI 生成文档、智能体产物和 IDE 垃圾越来越多，这种方法变得越来越实用。文章还提供了一个快速检查路径是否被忽略的命令：`git check-ignore -v`。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "通过黑名单方式管理 .gitignore 能减少意外提交不需要的本地文件",
      "explanation": "从 `*` 开始并只否定特定文件类型，开发者可以避免意外提交 IDE 配置、环境变量、node_modules、.DS_Store 或 AI 生成文档如 CLAUDE.md。"
    },
    {
      "point": "该技术在安全性上做出取舍，可能更契合现代开发工作流",
      "explanation": "作者承认它并非普遍适用，但指出随着智能体工具和 AI 文档带来的本地项目杂乱日益增多，采用「忽略一切」的基线策略反而更容易管理。"
    },
    {
      "point": "附带一个快速诊断命令用于验证 gitignore 的实际行为",
      "explanation": "运行 `git check-ignore -v <path>` 可以揭示某个文件被忽略或未追踪的原因，帮助解决预期文件未出现在仓库中的困惑。"
    }
  ],
